# December 9

## In Person

=== layout: one-panel

# Try Another Group's Activity

@body

1. [*Follow the other group's Google Doc*]{color=#007A00} without help from the authors.
2. [*Work in a fresh copy*]{color=#007A00} of their Google Sheet.
3. Compare your result with their expected answer.

Have any section you want in your final tutorial [*ready to try on Dec 9*]{color=#D40000}.

=== layout: one-panel

# Give Feedback Before You Leave

@body

Have [*one person from your testing group*]{color=#007A00} submit either the [*feedback form*]{color=#003FFF} or a [*short video*]{color=#003FFF}. Answer the same questions in either format.

- Did you finish?
- Did you get the expected result?
- Where did you get stuck, and what should the authors change?

We'll share your feedback with the authors.

[*No Quiz 3.*]{color=#D40000}

