# December 16

## Asynchronous

=== layout: one-panel

# Submit the Final Tutorial

@body

[*Revise your tutorial*]{color=#007A00} using the peer feedback.

- Have a group member [*rerun the changed steps*]{color=#007A00} in a fresh copy of the Sheet.
- Check that someone outside your group can [*open both files*]{color=#007A00}.

Submit one set per group for the course collection by [*Dec 16*]{color=#D40000}:

- [*Final Google Doc*]{color=#003FFF} with a title, one-sentence learning objective, data-source note, and checked answers or interpretations
- [*Clean Google Sheet*]{color=#003FFF} classmates can copy
- [*Brief revision note*]{color=#003FFF} on what changed after the peer trial

